    <bpmn:process id="W_W5072" name="W5072. LPG Forklift &amp; Bulk-Customer Account, Delivery &amp; Refill Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Trade/contractor/forklift-account bulk LPG need
Frequency: Recurring bulk delivery cycles
Volume: ~hundreds of bulk/forklift accounts at maturity
Owner: B2B/Trade Account Manager (VS-11/VS-107) / Category Manager
Participants: Trade/Key Account (VS-11/VS-107), Logistics (VS-06), O2C (VS-16), HSE (VS-24), Supplier (bulk — VS-03)
Source: workflow W5072 — LPG Forklift &amp; Bulk-Customer Account, Delivery &amp; Refill Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5072_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5072_Lane1" name="Account Mgr">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5072_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5072_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5072_Lane2" name="Logistics">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5072_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5072_Lane3" name="O2C">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5072_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5072_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5072_Start5" name="Trade/contractor/forklift-account bulk LPG need">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5072_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5072_Task6" name="Onboard &amp; contract the bulk account: credit/contract setup (VS-11/VS-107)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Onboard &amp; contract the bulk account: credit/contract setup (VS-11/VS-107), determine bulk-tank vs cylinder-for-forklift model, site-safety assessment, and delivery schedule
Responsible (R): Account Mgr / Logistics / HSE
Accountable (A): Category Mgr / Account Director
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5072_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5072_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5072_Task7" name="Deliver &amp; refill on schedule: recurring bulk/cylinder delivery (VS-06/VS-56)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Deliver &amp; refill on schedule: recurring bulk/cylinder delivery (VS-06/VS-56), refill/exchange on schedule, and DG-transport + site-handling safety (VS-114/VS-24)
Responsible (R): Logistics / Driver / HSE
Accountable (A): Logistics Manager
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5072_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5072_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5072_Task8" name="Bill &amp; reconcile: bulk/cylinder billing on credit terms (VS-16 O2C)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Bill &amp; reconcile: bulk/cylinder billing on credit terms (VS-16 O2C), cylinder-asset reconciliation for the account (W5076), and account profitability analytics
Responsible (R): O2C / Account Mgr / Analytics
Accountable (A): Category Mgr
Duration: Per cycle</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5072_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5072_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5072_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5072_Annotation10">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-756 (ensure controlled execution — Cylinder Exchange &amp; Refill Operations (PA-175.2).) | - CTL-756: bulk account credit-checked (VS-68); site-safety assessed (VS-24); cylinders reconciled (W5076); DG transport compliant (VS-114)
Owner: B2B/Trade Account Manager (VS-11/VS-107) / Category Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
